{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56247","headline":"判内门捉得御厨杂使衙官偷肉 · 宋光嗣","name":"判内门捉得御厨杂使衙官偷肉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斤斤肉是官家物，饱祭喉咙（一作「陇头」）更将出。\n不能爲食斩君头，领送右巡枷见骨。\n（均见四处何光远《监诫录》卷六《戏判作》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋光嗣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}